<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The costume window (uiinventory.py CostumeWindow, uiscript
	     costumewindow.py; P14 spec 6.2, Wave 6). The NovaUI inventory makes
	     nui_costume.CostumeWindow (controller assets/root/nui_costume.py), a
	     subclass of the legacy class whose slot window is a proxy over the
	     costume group of the wear table (nui_limits), bound to the
	     inventory's legacy handlers: the costume body and hair, and in the
	     foundation's table the costume sash, the weapon costume, the sash
	     costume and the aura costume (NOVA-20, 21, 23). Its cells are placed
	     by name (cos-wear--<name>) in each skin's sheet; an empty sash,
	     weapon, sash costume or aura cell shows its place's mark (w.marks).
	     The companion block, its divider and its title show only while the
	     table has one (has_companion: the buffi's costume body, hair and
	     weapon costume, NOVA-38, legacy's buffi panel; the cut hides it). The modern skin stands a
	     figure between the slots on a small rune circle: an image whose path
	     the controller passes, the male or the female one by the
	     character's race. Under the slots, legacy's five switches (NOVA-22),
	     toggle buttons down while the part shows (show_body, show_hair,
	     show_weapon, show_sash; the aura's wing_down opens its panel): a
	     left press is the switch proxy's click (cos_switch), so legacy's
	     handler asks the server. The aura panel (wing_open) holds a row per
	     aura flag (wing_rows); its check box only shows the state (the
	     board takes no focus, so a label never forwards a click), and a
	     left press on a row is that box's click (cos_wing_row). It exists
	     only while it shows, opens beside the inventory and moves alone
	     after, and draws below the legacy UI layer. A left or right press
	     anywhere on it raises the window (board_press), as legacy's window
	     manager raised the window under a press. The modern title bar leads
	     with a person glyph on the accent's tile, as the other item
	     windows'. -->
	<title>costume</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="costume.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" id="costume" class="nui-window nui-fx nui-anim nui-below-legacy-ui cos" data-model="costume" data-event-mousedown="board_press(ev.button)"
      data-class-inv--table-new="table == 'new'" data-class-inv--table-old="table == 'old'"
      data-class-cos--companion="has_companion">
	<div class="nui-window__titlebar cos__titlebar">
		<span class="cos-title-icon"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--character"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span
			class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></span>
		<handle id="cos-title" class="nui-window__handle cos__handle" move_target="#document">
			<span class="nui-window__title cos__title">@ui.COSTUME_WINDOW_TITLE</span>
		</handle>
		<button id="cos-close" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-button--icon nui-window__close nui-anim cos__close"
		        data-event-mousedown="close_press(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--close"><span
			class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
	</div>
	<div class="nui-window__body cos__body">
		<div id="cos-grid" class="cos-grid" data-for="g : wear_on" data-class-nui-attach-right="attach_right">
			<!-- The stage's art (today's table): the halo, the rune circle
			     (it turns the other way to the inventory's), the figure, and
			     the two empty frames legacy's costume art paints on the left. -->
			<div class="cos-stage">
				<div class="cos-stage__halo"></div>
				<div class="cos-stage__rune"><div class="cos-stage__spin nui-anim"><span
					class="cos-stage__ring cos-stage__ring--outer"></span><span class="cos-stage__ring cos-stage__ring--glow"></span><span
					class="cos-stage__ring cos-stage__ring--inner"></span><span class="cos-stage__chord cos-stage__chord--a"></span><span
					class="cos-stage__chord cos-stage__chord--b"></span><span class="cos-stage__chord cos-stage__chord--c"></span><span
					class="cos-stage__chord cos-stage__chord--d"></span><span class="cos-stage__chord cos-stage__chord--e"></span><span
					class="cos-stage__chord cos-stage__chord--f"></span></div></div>
				<div class="cos-stage__figure"><img class="cos-stage__image nui-fx" data-if="figure != ''" data-attr-src="figure"/></div>
				<span class="cos-stage__frame cos-stage__frame--a"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--sword cos-stage__mark"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span
					class="nui-glyph__b"></span><span class="nui-glyph__c"></span></span></span><span class="cos-stage__frame cos-stage__frame--b"><span
					class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--pentagon cos-stage__mark"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></span><span
					class="cos-stage__frame cos-stage__frame--c"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--ring cos-stage__mark"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span
					class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></span>
			</div>
			<div class="cos-divider" data-if="has_companion"></div>
			<span class="cos-companion-title" data-if="has_companion">@ui.COSTUME_WINDOW_BUFFICOSTUME</span>
			<div class="cos-wear-place" data-for="w : slots" data-attr-class="'cos-wear-place cos-wear--' + w.name">
				<div class="nui-slot nui-anim cos-wear" data-attr-id="'cos-wear-' + w.name"
				     data-class-is-empty="w.kind == ''" data-class-is-target="w.target == 'move'"
				     data-class-is-blocked="w.target == 'blocked'"
				     data-event-mousedown="cos_press(it_index, ev.button)" data-event-mouseup="cos_release(it_index, ev.button)"
				     data-event-dblclick="cos_use(it_index)" data-event-mouseover="cos_over(it_index)"
				     data-event-mouseout="cos_out(it_index)" data-event-nuidrop="cos_drop(it_index)">
					<img class="nui-slot__icon" data-if="w.icon != ''" data-attr-src="w.icon"/>
					<nui-number class="nui-slot__number" data-if="w.count != ''" data-attr-value="w.count"/>
					<!-- An empty sash, weapon, sash costume or aura place's mark
					     (w.marks: none, or its glyph's name; classic hides glyphs). -->
					<span data-for="m : w.marks" data-attr-class="'nui-glyph cos-wear__mark nui-glyph--' + m"><span
						class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span><span class="nui-glyph__c"></span></span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<!-- The switches (uiscript Activate*_ON_OFF): down while the part shows. -->
		<div class="cos-switches">
			<button id="cos-show-body" class="nui-button nui-button--medium nui-anim cos-switch cos-switch--body"
			        data-class-is-selected="show_body" data-event-mousedown="cos_switch('body', ev.button)">@ui.COSTUME_SHOW_BODY</button>
			<button id="cos-show-hair" class="nui-button nui-button--medium nui-anim cos-switch cos-switch--hair"
			        data-class-is-selected="show_hair" data-event-mousedown="cos_switch('hair', ev.button)">@ui.COSTUME_SHOW_HAIR</button>
			<button id="cos-show-weapon" class="nui-button nui-button--medium nui-anim cos-switch cos-switch--weapon"
			        data-class-is-selected="show_weapon" data-event-mousedown="cos_switch('weapon', ev.button)">@ui.COSTUME_SHOW_WEAPON</button>
			<button id="cos-show-sash" class="nui-button nui-button--medium nui-anim cos-switch cos-switch--sash"
			        data-class-is-selected="show_sash" data-event-mousedown="cos_switch('sash', ev.button)">@ui.COSTUME_SHOW_SASH</button>
			<button id="cos-show-aura" class="nui-button nui-button--medium nui-anim cos-switch cos-switch--aura"
			        data-class-is-selected="wing_down" data-event-mousedown="cos_switch('wing', ev.button)">@ui.COSTUME_SHOW_AURA</button>
		</div>
		<!-- The aura panel (legacy's __CreateAuraWingPanel board): a row per
		     aura flag; the check box shows the state, a press on the row flips it. -->
		<div id="cos-wing" class="cos-wing" data-if="wing_open">
			<label class="nui-toggle cos-wing__row" data-for="r : wing_rows" data-attr-id="'cos-wing-' + r.key"
			       data-event-mousedown="cos_wing_row(it_index, ev.button)">
				<input type="checkbox" class="nui-toggle__input" data-attrif-checked="r.checked"/>
				<span class="nui-toggle__track nui-anim"><span class="nui-toggle__knob nui-anim"></span></span>
				<span class="nui-toggle__label" data-if="r.key == 'wing'">@game.AURA_WING_SHOW_WING</span>
				<span class="nui-toggle__label" data-if="r.key == 'aura'">@game.AURA_WING_SHOW_AURA</span>
				<span class="nui-toggle__label" data-if="r.key == 'effect'">@game.AURA_WING_SHOW_EFFECT</span>
			</label>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
